<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar military is now targeting and destroying bridges across Arakan while also planning a 108‑kilometer fence along the border with Bangladesh. It has launched airstrikes on a displacement camp in Rakhine state that killed 12 people and carried out a double-tap strike on civilians, and it is advancing west of the Sittaung River, prompting further civilian flight. ASEAN leaders continue to denounce the violence, extend the ban on Myanmar’s leader and pursue a conditional, progress-based approach to its political return, while the junta seeks legitimacy through by-elections. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNb2plekZ4aE15TUFLemFKblVBdWYySzdRMHNRbmhpZjc2dkxQOWxHMG9qQmQxUFpfNTRkcHNWYkNKQXVveUtnSUxqNG00Q2hjQ0lJWWZaMUc4RUxkVWtUOGZhQUk0MGJEUHVuSDRkZmFSZ2x5VFR0bFUzOVl1OVE0R0lBR2RYZHpIdE4wYzRyZ3haRjZweFhPVVpZNF91Ynpad1k1T0RXUndNNXQzb2xEcXNyaUVJd1Y3Z1lIWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPZ1BsWk1oTHMxeEhDd3N5a2E0NU9TOUJHNmF2ODUtTHIyaTh5akFCYkRlYVVLNjkxRktKN0NBWk9pZW02cGRsY3YyWGYxbm5uQWFjcE5JazdYVU5SdUNvbHJwNkJzNmFpb09DWWFldGFHYWoxRXFtWGNpdjdveUtMbWhkcllHbXV2b1NqNWo4bnk1aGhrdU5qUWVXaTlUSjlDZmVhTFNLVVBoUWp0azZVUWEzUDdTQkkyLUJTRG9XU1N6S3VUcmJtZ0ZKbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9FQ1J2MGxPRE1lWXJRUUh6R1R4d3RMWDdGanhGZGNvR3YwNnEyY3RsaGJjUmpSQlQ0WVdjY1phaHhqVnhFLVlZRnpIcmZWY2Y5R2p1NUhrVFl2OTBycTd6NXROVDhhY0Fnay0yMm1kRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Narinjara News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h